     3260   get-frpay-name (temp-cash-pay-list.frpay-code) @ v-frpay-name
     3261   WITH BROWSE br-cash-pay-list.
     3262   br-cash-pay-list:REFRESH() IN FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3263   end.
